  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Vraile.jpg\" title=\"Loremaster Vraile\"><img alt=\"Loremaster Vraile\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"237\" src=\"/images/Vraile.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Vraile.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Loremaster Vraile</div></div></div>\n<p>Loremaster Vraile is located in <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a> across the river from the banker and just up the hill from <a href=\"/wiki/Louard_the_Arms_Merchant\" title=\"Louard the Arms Merchant\">Louard the Arms Merchant</a>.\n</p><p>He is a Quest Giver. His quests are at <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Loremaster_Vraile_Quests\" title=\"Category:Loremaster Vraile Quests\">Loremaster Vraile Quests</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
